                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "OK, really underlying this review is  a very good game.  I'm giving this a negative review because it SHOULD NOT have left early access yet.  Relatively simple polishing that should have been required to release the game have not been implemented - two examples: 1) remapping keybindings 2) better ship building tools (ie rotate before placement).\n\nIts a shame -its a good game, but IMO the rush to 1.0 cannot be excused.  I'll happily change this review if they fix some of these basic problems.",
